 "brief_summary": "This study is being carried out to see if dapagliflozin in addition to glimepiride (sulphonylurea) is effective and safe in treating patients with type 2 diabetes when compared to glimepiride alone.",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Type 2 Diabetes\n* Treatment with a stable sulphonylurea monotherapy dose that is at least half the maximal recommended dose for a minimum of 8 weeks prior to study\n* Inadequate glycaemic control, defined as A1C ≥ 7.0 % and ≤ 10%\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Type 1 Diabetes\n* Hepatic (liver) impairment\n* Renal (kidney) failure or dysfunction",
